# Archived third-party HTML responses are test data, not rendered application
# templates. They are covered by fixture parsers and adversarial tests.
fixtures/*.html

# GitHub Actions workflows are parsed and gated by the pinned zizmor workflow.
# Semgrep's embedded-shell parser cannot parse GitHub expression syntax and
# otherwise emits PartialParsing errors rather than actionable results.
.github/workflows/**

# Unit and integration tests intentionally exercise hostile URLs, SHA-1 from
# the RFC 6455 handshake, XML parsers, and dynamic process stubs. Production
# sources remain scanned; test behavior is governed by pytest/go test gates.
tests/**
**/*_test.go
